  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've placed a free replacement for your Green Bowl order:\n\n- **Replacement order:** RP-900\n- **Items:** Harvest bowl and Green juice\n- **Delivering to:** 58 Aspen Way, Oakdale, CA 94619\n- **Cost to you:** $0.00\n- **ETA:** about 45\u201360 minutes\n\nTo sum up tonight:\n- **K-6301 (Lotus Garden):** cancelled, and $30.18 refunded to your Visa ending 4242\n- **K-6302 (Burger Barn):** already picked up, so the address couldn't be changed. It's still going to 58 Aspen Way.\n- **K-6303 (Green Bowl):** free replacement on its way\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, hold on. The Burger Barn order is still going to 58 Aspen Way? I gave you 22 Birch Ln, and that's where my friend is. Aspen Way is my place. Can you fix this? If the courier has it, can someone call them or send it to Birch Ln another way?"
