   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry, Chloe. I know that's frustrating. I'm not able to send the Burger Barn order to 22 Birch Ln. The courier picked it up at 7:20 PM, and once an order has been picked up, its delivery address can't be changed. I also can't contact the courier to redirect it, and no one else at Forkful can reroute it either.\n\nThis is what will happen: the courier will bring order **K-6302** to **58 Aspen Way**, due around 7:35 PM. A few things that may help:\n\n- **If someone is at Aspen Way,** have them take the order so the delivery doesn't fail.\n- **Watch the app for the courier.** If they call when they arrive, be ready to answer. If the courier can't reach anyone, the delivery may fail, and our policy doesn't allow a refund in that case.\n- **To get the food to your friend,** you'd need to pick it up from Aspen Way and take it over yourself.\n\nI'm sorry I can't do more on this one. Can I help with anything else?"
