  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, I can confirm that replacement **RP-900** is going to **58 Aspen Way, Oakdale, CA 94619**, the same address as the original Green Bowl order. It should arrive in about 45\u201360 minutes, so roughly 8:15\u20138:30 PM.\n\nSince you're not at Aspen Way right now, keep in mind that both deliveries are going there tonight:\n- **Burger Barn (K-6302):** due around 7:35 PM\n- **Green Bowl replacement (RP-900):** around 8:15\u20138:30 PM\n\nPlease make sure someone can receive them or that you can answer the courier's calls. If a delivery fails because no one can be reached, I won't be able to refund or replace it.\n\nCan I help with anything else?"
